[l_english.autonomy_pihc_licensed]
Nominal Subject

[l_english.autonomy_pihc_licensed_desc]
It is only nominally subject to the master country, and is almost completely independent of the master country in administration.

[l_simp_chinese.autonomy_pihc_licensed]
名义属地

[l_simp_chinese.autonomy_pihc_licensed_desc]
仅仅是名义上服从宗主国，行政上几乎完全独立于宗主国。
